	(text "ESP32-P4 board (Waveshare 3.4C) on the navball USB = hub port 1.\nU10 pins = J8 socket pins of the board (2x20, 2.54mm). Mate with a MALE 2x20 header.\nFootprint drawn to scale from the manufacturer DXF/STEP: pin 1 = marker square on the board socket; pins 38/40 = 5V.\n3V3 pins are the board's own outputs: left unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
